[E0310] Error: an `f32` cannot hold the integer literal `16777217` exactly
    ╭─[ err/629_an_integer_literal_a_float_would_round/main.wip:12:20 ]
    │
 12 │     val big: f32 = 16_777_217
    │                    ─────┬────
    │                         ╰────── it would be rounded
    │
    │ Help: write it as a float literal, `16777217.0`, which says it is rounded
    │
    │ Note: an `f32` holds every whole number up to 16777216 exactly, and past it only those of 24 significant bits
